		{
			dependencies: ["51CF36FC1CEF6618"]
			description: [
				""
				""
				"可以通过多种方式找到<grad from=#F2F5F7 to=#A8B2BA f=0.5>原始钛矿</grad>："
				""
				"<grad from=#E1B3FF to=#9C4DFF f=0.5>心形草药</grad> - 从草药垂直向下挖掘。深度是随机的，可能就在草药下方，也可能深至基岩。钛会出现在小型晶洞中，与 <grad from=#A8E6FF to=#3552B0 f=0.5>振金</grad> 一同生成，是一种非常稀有的资源。"
				""
				""
				"{image:kubejs:item/vibranium_find width:90 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"<grad from=#E0D6C8 to=#9E9E9E f=0.5>可疑的砾石</grad> - 刷取在 <grad from=#C5E1A5 to=#7CB342 f=0.5>加尔文修道院</grad>、<grad from=#FFCC80 to=#FF7043 f=0.5>爆破室</grad>和 <grad from=#B0BEC5 to=#78909C f=0.5>机械堡垒</grad>中找到的砾石。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"<c1>Guaranteed Pieces</c1> - 一件在<c2>Machine Stronghold</c2>雕像的箱子里，另一件在<c3>Galvan Priory</c3>的挖掘点。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"<grad from=#C5E1A5 to=#7CB342 f=0.5>Galvan Pods</grad> - 偶尔会在它们内部或周围发现。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"<grad from=#C5E1A5 to=#7CB342 f=0.5>加电学家村民</grad> - 作为大师级交易出售。"
			]
